WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
Humanity has finally done

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.480
what is long overdue.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.400
To arrive at the beginning of the end 

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.520
of fossil fuels.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.520
At COP28 the world rallied.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:17.200
To accelerate emission reductions.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.320
To triple renewable energy capacity.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.320
And to double the rate of

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.000
energy efficiency improvements by 2030.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:32.600
To set up a loss and damage fund.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.440
to support the most vulnerables countries.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:41.240
and to transition away from fossil fuels.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.760
Today the world takes an important step

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.600
to limit global warming to 1.5 degrees.

